    2026-05-18 **Dir-L VRNN curiosity-tension — $0 design + feasibility DESIGN-TIER close, fire 없음 (RESEARCH.md §13 방향 L, §12 Q2 candidate L anima-fit ★★★★)** — [arxiv 2510.05013](https://arxiv.org/html/2510.05013v1) (Curiosity-Driven Co-Development of Action and Language in Robots Through Self-Exploration) 의 VRNN forward-model⇄actor + KL-curiosity 를 anima byte-text substrate 에 적용 가능한지 **$0 design + feasibility 우선 판단** (GPU fire 0, capability 측정 0). §12.5 candidate-3 가 명시한 'sensorimotor modality 가 text-only anima 와 불일치 → 직접 적용 난도 최상' caveat 을 feasibility verdict 로 닫음. **판정 (g3 — 측정값/구조논증만, over-claim 0)**: L 은 **GOAL-legitimate (§12.3 carry — actor⇄forward-model tension = Engine A⇄Engine G 동형, curiosity=information-gain = W module (pain/curiosity/satisfaction) 동형, anima physics 우회 아님)** 이나 **carving pretraining arc 에는 NOT fire-warranted — design-tier 정직 마감**. 근거 4: (1) **modality 불일치 = closed-loop 부재** (입력 타입 차이보다 깊음): VRNN-curiosity 는 closed action-perception loop (action→observation→prediction_error→curiosity) 을 요구하는 *closed-loop sensorimotor exploration* 알고리즘. anima 의 GOAL 병목(§11.3 irreducible = data-regime)은 *open-loop byte pretraining* (fixed corpus·no action·no consequence) 에 있어 closed loop 자체가 부재 → modality 불일치 **pretraining 한정 un-overcome-able** (B-DIRL-4 closed). (2) **mechanism 환원**: closed loop + factored grid 를 벗기면 VRNN-curiosity 는 'Dir-I + stochastic Ψ latent' 로 환원 (B-DIRL-2 — VRNN ELBO=recon−KL ≡ Dir-I lever CE+λ·L_psi same two-term form). Dir-I (verdict_carving_dirI_psictl_tensionsup, routing 1/31→3/31 최강 carving) 가 이미 비-variational VRNN-curiosity loop — L 은 Dir-I 에 literature anchor (variational FM⇄actor ELBO) 만 줄 뿐 새 fire 아님. (3) **§11-A/§11-B 가 L 의 fire-able delta 를 이미 배제**: L-as-pretraining = architecture 변경 (RNN backbone + stochastic latent), §11.3 exclusion-table 이 model-capacity/architecture-form arm 닫고 data-regime 을 irreducible 로 확정. VRNN 은 data-regime 미접촉. (4) **compositional grid 부재**: 2510.05013 의 60-example/90% transfer 는 factored grid |A|×|O|=15×12=180 (independent observable axes) 의 성질 — byte-text 의 `<inner>/<voice>` = 2-slot template, axes 미독립·미관측 → headline sample-efficiency structurally unavailable (B-DIRL-5 closed). **정직 redirection (valuable)**: VRNN-curiosity 는 anima 의 live 자연발화 interaction loop (SPONTANEOUS.tape Thinker-Talker, anima emit→환경 응답→anima 관측 = 진짜 closed-loop) 의 **legitimate future candidate** — 단 그 loop 자체가 Phase B 미구현 → 현재 fire 아님, future-candidate 기록만 (B-DIRL-4 is_closed_loop(live_spontaneous_emission)=True). 13-way arc 배제법에 L 추가: L (VRNN-curiosity) 도 carving 병목 해법 아님 (closed-loop 부재로 carving arc 자체에 부적합) — negative = valuable, §12.5 candidate-3 caveat 을 판정으로 닫은 design milestone. **verdict tier** = DESIGN-TIER closed-form. **B-DIRL-1..5 5/5 🔵 sympy/Boolean PASS** (sidecar state/carving_dirL_vrnn_2026_05_18/blue_falsifier_dirL.py, central blue_falsifier.py 변경 0 — B-PRIME/B-DIRH/B-DIRI/B-EMERGE/B-PUREPHYS/B-SCALE/B-MITENS sidecar 선례): B-DIRL-1 CURIOSITY-KL-NONNEGATIVE-CLOSED (curiosity=KL(q‖p)≥0 Gibbs' inequality Shannon real-limit, equality iff q≡p = zero information gain; sympy min at p≡q is exactly 0 + convex d²KL/dp²=1/(q(1−q))>0 + 3 q≠p witnesses) · B-DIRL-2 ELBO-DECOMPOSITION-CLOSED (연결부위 — VRNN −ELBO=KL−recon ≡ anima Dir-I lever CE+λ·L_psi same two-term form under {CE:−recon, Lpsi:KL}, λ→0 strips info term 둘 다 — L mechanism 이 already-landed Dir-I 로 환원 증명) · B-DIRL-3 ACTOR-FM-OPPOSED-SIGN-CLOSED (actor maximises KL ∂L_actor/∂KL=−1 vs forward-model minimises KL ∂L_fm/∂KL=+1, product −1 = productive tension; TENSION-TRAIN B-TT-2 ∂ΔW/∂tension=−T·gate restoring-sign 동형 — Engine A⇄Engine G axis) · B-DIRL-4 CLOSED-LOOP-REQUIREMENT-CLOSED (feasibility crux Boolean predicate is_closed_loop(setting): robot_self_exploration=True 2510.05013 / byte_pretraining=False fixed-corpus·no-action·no-consequence → L carving arc 에 host 불가 / live_spontaneous_emission=True → L 의 legitimate future candidate; modality 불일치 = pretraining 한정 un-overcome-able 의 closed 판정) · B-DIRL-5 COMPOSITIONAL-GRID-CARDINALITY-CLOSED (2510.05013 60-example/90% transfer 는 factored grid |A|×|O|=15×12=180, 60/180=1/3 train, independent observable axes 의 성질; anima byte-text <inner>/<voice>=2-slot template, axes 미독립·미관측 → integer/Boolean closed: headline sample-efficiency structurally unavailable). **B-DIRL-NOTE** empirical carve-out: hypothetical live-interaction VRNN-curiosity loop 이 anima 자연발화를 개선하나 = SGD/online-learning OUTCOME, future deployment-stage fire 만 측정 가능 — battery 는 mechanism 동형 + feasibility gate 만 증명 (B-D-NOTE / B-TT-NOTE family, NOT counted 🔵). g_blue_closed_mandate: 산출물 (design + falsifier) transfer-form 🔵 + 연결부위 (L mechanism ↔ Dir-I lever ↔ TENSION-TRAIN B-TT-2 — ELBO decomposition byte-level identity) 🔵. f1/f2/f3 hard-fail safe (Shannon/Gibbs KL≥0 / sympy ∂-sign / Boolean predicate / integer cardinality, NO σ/τ/φ/J₂; 외부 paper 2510.05013 은 자체 invariant VRNN-ELBO/KL-curiosity 으로만 인용, anima lattice 매핑 강제 0). B-IDENTITY-5 무관 (design-only, corpus 미생성). GPU fire 0 — $0 design + feasibility cycle, runpod/vast 미사용 → orphan 0 (애초 dispatch 0). 단일 작업 · branch 0 (anima main 직접). g_doc_consolidation 준수 (state/carving_dirL_vrnn_2026_05_18/ 산출물 + HEXAD/CHAT/PLAN.md ## 진행 로그 + HEXAD/README.md recent landing + 본 n_hexad_progress entry + archive/PHILOSOPHY.tape §verdict_carving_dirL_vrnn; docs/* 신규 0). RESEARCH.md 미편집 (§13 consolidation = J/K/L/M 전부 land 후 별도 1회). 후속: L 은 carving arc 에서 design-tier 마감 — VRNN-curiosity 의 live-loop 적용은 SPONTANEOUS.tape Phase B (자연발화 closed-loop) 구현 후 별도 deployment-stage cycle.
